              "content": "{玩家转向Actor0}萨飞里，从上周三开始，\n你见到我就刻意绕行的平均距离是8.5米。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990014_1917485728_content",
                "value": "{玩家转向Actor0}萨飞里，从上周三开始，\n你见到我就刻意绕行的平均距离是8.5米。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
